  * CLI (main.go, config.go, cmdusage.go, analyze.go, find.go, ls.go, stats.go, db.go)
    * Commands moved to the new config API.
    * Usage text updated.
    * New coverage in main_test.go and analyze_test.go.
  * internal/database/badgerdb
    * New functionality in badgerdb.go (+28), with tests and README notes.
  * internal (scandb.go, util.go)
